feat: IndexNow submission for Bing, Yandex, Seznam and Naver

One POST notifies every participating engine that a URL changed. No account and
no verification flow: ownership is proved by the key file served at the site
root, so this works the moment it deploys.

- public/<key>.txt holds the key
- scripts/indexnow.mjs reads public/sitemap.xml and submits every URL, or just
  the paths passed as arguments
- npm run indexnow

Run it after any deploy that changes content. It is the fastest route into Bing,
which is also what feeds DuckDuckGo, Yahoo, Copilot and ChatGPT search.

